{
    "title": "Caesars Rewards Resort Offers",
    "description": "Enhance your casino & resort experience with the free Caesars Rewards\u00ae mobile app. It is your portal to Caesars Entertainment\u2019s gaming and resort destinations. The best of Las Vegas, Atlantic City, New Orleans and more is at your fingertips. Explore our hotels, resorts, casinos, shows, restaurants, attractions and nightclubs and book memorable experiences wherever you are, whenever you want.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022 Conveniently explore 50+ casinos and resorts, shows and restaurants.\r\n\u2022 Make mobile reservations for hotel rooms, shows and restaurants easily and securely.\r\n\u2022 Access your offers anytime and receive mobile exclusive offers available only in our mobile app.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy a personalized experience with location-based recommendations.\r\n\u2022 View your Reward Credits\u00ae and Tier Status at a glance.\r\n\u2022 Join Caesars Rewards\u00ae and earn towards free hotel stays and other perks.\r\n\u2022 Save itineraries for future stays in Las Vegas, Atlantic City, New Orleans and more, and keep your plans handy.\r\n\r\nWhy Book Through the Caesars Rewards mobile app?\r\n\u2022 BEST Rate Guarantee\r\n\u2022 MOBILE Check-in, Check-out\r\n\u2022 FREE 72-Hour Cancellation\r\n\u2022 EXCLUSIVE Member Pricing and Benefits\r\nEnhance any experience at Caesars Palace, Harrah\u2019s, Horseshoe or any of our other hotel & resorts with our free Caesars Rewards mobile app.\r\n\r\nAbout Us:\r\nSince its beginning in Reno, Nevada, more than 80 years ago, Caesars Entertainment has grown through the development of new resorts, expansions and acquisitions, and now operates casinos on four continents. What started out as a bingo parlor opened by William Harrah in 1937 has grown to include iconic brands like Caesars Palace, Flamingo, Harrah\u2019s and Horseshoe and trailblazing digital experiences including Caesars Sportsbook, Caesars Palace Online Casino, and Horseshoe Online Casino.\r\n\r\nBrands:\r\n\u2022 Caesars Palace \r\n\u2022 Caesars\r\n\u2022 Caesars Republic \r\n\u2022 Circus Circus Reno \r\n\u2022 Eldorado \r\n\u2022 Flamingo \r\n\u2022 Grand Victoria \r\n\u2022 Harrah\u2019s \r\n\u2022 Harveys \r\n\u2022 Horseshoe\r\n\u2022 Isle \r\n\u2022 Lady Luck \r\n\u2022 Paris \r\n\u2022 Planet Hollywood Resort & Casino \r\n\u2022 Silver Legacy \r\n\u2022 The Cromwell \r\n\u2022 The LINQ Hotel & Casino\r\n\u2022 Tropicana\r\n\r\nCheck out some of our most popular destinations: \r\nLas Vegas, Atlantic City, Lake Tahoe, Laughlin, New Orleans, Philadelphia, Northern California, Southern California, Virginia, Windsor, Baltimore, Kansas City & Biloxi.\r\n\r\nPartners:\r\n\u2022 Caesars Rewards Visa\u00ae\r\n\u2022 Caesars Rewards Live Events\u00ae \r\n\u2022 Atlantis Paradise Island\r\n\u2022 Wyndham Rewards\u00ae\r\n\u2022 Norwegian Cruise Line\u00ae\r\n\u2022 Caesars Rewards Dining\r\n\u2022 Caesars Rewards eCatalog\r\n\u2022 Say & Play\r\n\u2022 1-800-Flowers.com\u00ae\r\n\u2022 World Series Of Poker\u00ae\r\n\u2022 Caesars Rewards Gift Cards\r\n\u2022 National Car Rental\u00ae\r\n\r\nCaesars Entertainment is an official sponsor of the NFL.\r\n\r\nDisclaimers:\r\nContinued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.\r\nIf you are prohibited from entering or gaming at any Caesars Entertainment property or if you participate in any gaming self-exclusion program, please do not download or use the Caesars Rewards mobile app. Offers received by guests who are not permitted to enter or play at Caesars Entertainment properties are invalid.\r\n\r\nGambling Problem? Call 1-800-GAMBLER.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enhance your casino &amp; resort experience with the free Caesars Rewards\u00ae mobile app. It is your portal to Caesars Entertainment\u2019s gaming and resort destinations. The best of Las Vegas, Atlantic City, New Orleans and more is at your fingertips. Explore our hotels, resorts, casinos, shows, restaurants, attractions and nightclubs and book memorable experiences wherever you are, whenever you want.<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022 Conveniently explore 50+ casinos and resorts, shows and restaurants.<br>\u2022 Make mobile reservations for hotel rooms, shows and restaurants easily and securely.<br>\u2022 Access your offers anytime and receive mobile exclusive offers available only in our mobile app.<br>\u2022 Enjoy a personalized experience with location-based recommendations.<br>\u2022 View your Reward Credits\u00ae and Tier Status at a glance.<br>\u2022 Join Caesars Rewards\u00ae and earn towards free hotel stays and other perks.<br>\u2022 Save itineraries for future stays in Las Vegas, Atlantic City, New Orleans and more, and keep your plans handy.<br><br>Why Book Through the Caesars Rewards mobile app?<br>\u2022 BEST Rate Guarantee<br>\u2022 MOBILE Check-in, Check-out<br>\u2022 FREE 72-Hour Cancellation<br>\u2022 EXCLUSIVE Member Pricing and Benefits<br>Enhance any experience at Caesars Palace, Harrah\u2019s, Horseshoe or any of our other hotel &amp; resorts with our free Caesars Rewards mobile app.<br><br>About Us:<br>Since its beginning in Reno, Nevada, more than 80 years ago, Caesars Entertainment has grown through the development of new resorts, expansions and acquisitions, and now operates casinos on four continents. What started out as a bingo parlor opened by William Harrah in 1937 has grown to include iconic brands like Caesars Palace, Flamingo, Harrah\u2019s and Horseshoe and trailblazing digital experiences including Caesars Sportsbook, Caesars Palace Online Casino, and Horseshoe Online Casino.<br><br>Brands:<br>\u2022 Caesars Palace <br>\u2022 Caesars<br>\u2022 Caesars Republic <br>\u2022 Circus Circus Reno <br>\u2022 Eldorado <br>\u2022 Flamingo <br>\u2022 Grand Victoria <br>\u2022 Harrah\u2019s <br>\u2022 Harveys <br>\u2022 Horseshoe<br>\u2022 Isle <br>\u2022 Lady Luck <br>\u2022 Paris <br>\u2022 Planet Hollywood Resort &amp; Casino <br>\u2022 Silver Legacy <br>\u2022 The Cromwell <br>\u2022 The LINQ Hotel &amp; Casino<br>\u2022 Tropicana<br><br>Check out some of our most popular destinations: <br>Las Vegas, Atlantic City, Lake Tahoe, Laughlin, New Orleans, Philadelphia, Northern California, Southern California, Virginia, Windsor, Baltimore, Kansas City &amp; Biloxi.<br><br>Partners:<br>\u2022 Caesars Rewards Visa\u00ae<br>\u2022 Caesars Rewards Live Events\u00ae <br>\u2022 Atlantis Paradise Island<br>\u2022 Wyndham Rewards\u00ae<br>\u2022 Norwegian Cruise Line\u00ae<br>\u2022 Caesars Rewards Dining<br>\u2022 Caesars Rewards eCatalog<br>\u2022 Say &amp; Play<br>\u2022 1-800-Flowers.com\u00ae<br>\u2022 World Series Of Poker\u00ae<br>\u2022 Caesars Rewards Gift Cards<br>\u2022 National Car Rental\u00ae<br><br>Caesars Entertainment is an official sponsor of the NFL.<br><br>Disclaimers:<br>Continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.<br>If you are prohibited from entering or gaming at any Caesars Entertainment property or if you participate in any gaming self-exclusion program, please do not download or use the Caesars Rewards mobile app. Offers received by guests who are not permitted to enter or play at Caesars Entertainment properties are invalid.<br><br>Gambling Problem? Call 1-800-GAMBLER.",
